{"id":"bcfb34cebd3499cf","group":"29","path":"29/29-prop-dynamic-parity.md","title":"奇偶性的一阶动态维护","display":"prop-dynamic-parity — 奇偶性的一阶动态维护","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-prop-dynamic-parity","aliases":["29-prop-dynamic-parity"],"display":"prop-dynamic-parity — 奇偶性的一阶动态维护","depends_on":["[[29-df-dyn-fo]]"],"source_locator":"Proposition14.16 and its proof, pp.228–230, scans243–245","source_basis":"原书文本层及扫描244原图；以一元全空/全满关系实现布尔位并复核不变量","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-prop-dynamic-parity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-prop-dynamic-parity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-dynamic-parity — 奇偶性的一阶动态维护"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f49962f64360a930\" href=\"?note=f49962f64360a930\" title=\"29-df-dyn-fo\">29-df-dyn-fo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Proposition14.16 and its proof, pp.228–230, scans243–245"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层及扫描244原图；以一元全空/全满关系实现布尔位并复核不变量"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S^{(1)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S^{(1)}\\rangle\\)</span>，辅助词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\langle B^{(1)}\\rangle\">\\(\\rho=\\langle B^{(1)}\\rangle\\)</span>；动态接口使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f49962f64360a930\" href=\"?note=f49962f64360a930\" title=\"29-df-dyn-fo\">29-df-dyn-fo</a>，所有历史合法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne a\">\\(x\\ne a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是辅助一元关系的个体论元变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是更新请求的个体参数变量。下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_B,\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},S,B},\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},S,B},\\theta\">\\(\\eta_B,\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},S,B},\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},S,B},\\theta\\)</span> 确定固定程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{\\oplus}\">\\(\\Pi_{\\oplus}\\)</span>；它们是对象语言一阶公式。</li>\n<li>辅助关系符号是新符号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(\\rho)\\cap(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{\\leq\\})=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\rho)\\cap(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{\\leq\\})=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid |S^A|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid |S^A|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_B(x)\\coloneqq(x\\ne x),\\qquad\\theta\\coloneqq\\exists x\\;B(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_B(x)\\coloneqq(x\\ne x),\\qquad\\theta\\coloneqq\\exists x\\;B(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},S,B}(x;a)\\coloneqq(B(x)\\land S(a))\\lor(\\neg B(x)\\land\\neg S(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},S,B}(x;a)\\coloneqq(B(x)\\land S(a))\\lor(\\neg B(x)\\land\\neg S(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},S,B}(x;a)\\coloneqq(B(x)\\land\\neg S(a))\\lor(\\neg B(x)\\land S(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},S,B}(x;a)\\coloneqq(B(x)\\land\\neg S(a))\\lor(\\neg B(x)\\land S(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{o,1,1}\\coloneqq\\delta_{o,S,B}\\quad(o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}),\\qquad\\Pi_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq(\\langle B^{(1)}\\rangle,\\langle\\langle x\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\langle a\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\eta_B\\rangle,(\\delta_{o,1,1})_o,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{o,1,1}\\coloneqq\\delta_{o,S,B}\\quad(o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}),\\qquad\\Pi_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq(\\langle B^{(1)}\\rangle,\\langle\\langle x\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\langle a\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\eta_B\\rangle,(\\delta_{o,1,1})_o,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;\\left(B^{B_t^{\\Pi_{\\oplus},n,h}}=\\begin{cases}U_n,&amp;|S^{A_t^{n,h}}|\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;|S^{A_t^{n,h}}|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\end{cases}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;\\left(B^{B_t^{\\Pi_{\\oplus},n,h}}=\\begin{cases}U_n,&amp;|S^{A_t^{n,h}}|\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;|S^{A_t^{n,h}}|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\end{cases}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi_{\\oplus},Q_{\\oplus},H^{\\rm all}_\\tau),\\qquad Q_{\\oplus}\\in\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi_{\\oplus},Q_{\\oplus},H^{\\rm all}_\\tau),\\qquad Q_{\\oplus}\\in\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>初态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 均为空。若插入的元素已有，或删除的元素原本没有，输入和辅助位均不变；有效插入或删除恰好改变一个成员，两个公式都把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 从全空翻为全满或反之。因此按历史长度归纳得到所示不变量；因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x B(x)\">\\(\\exists x B(x)\\)</span> 正好读出奇数状态。</p>\n<p>此结论是动态维护；不能因此断言存在一个不带辅助状态的静态 FO 奇偶性公式。本条不对尚未定义的 RAMTIME 接口作额外断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-dyn-fo","status":"resolved","id":"f49962f64360a930","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-dyn-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-dyn-fo","status":"resolved","id":"f49962f64360a930","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle S^{(1)}\\rangle$，辅助词汇 $\\rho=\\langle B^{(1)}\\rangle$；动态接口使用 [[29-df-dyn-fo]]，所有历史合法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S^{(1)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=\\langle B^{(1)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ne a","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_B,\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},S,B},\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},S,B},\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{\\oplus}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sym}(\\rho)\\cap(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{\\leq\\})=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid |S^A|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta_B(x)\\coloneqq(x\\ne x),\\qquad\\theta\\coloneqq\\exists x\\;B(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},S,B}(x;a)\\coloneqq(B(x)\\land S(a))\\lor(\\neg B(x)\\land\\neg S(a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},S,B}(x;a)\\coloneqq(B(x)\\land\\neg S(a))\\lor(\\neg B(x)\\land S(a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_{o,1,1}\\coloneqq\\delta_{o,S,B}\\quad(o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}),\\qquad\\Pi_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq(\\langle B^{(1)}\\rangle,\\langle\\langle x\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\langle a\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\eta_B\\rangle,(\\delta_{o,1,1})_o,\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;\\left(B^{B_t^{\\Pi_{\\oplus},n,h}}=\\begin{cases}U_n,&|S^{A_t^{n,h}}|\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\varnothing,&|S^{A_t^{n,h}}|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\end{cases}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi_{\\oplus},Q_{\\oplus},H^{\\rm all}_\\tau),\\qquad Q_{\\oplus}\\in\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x B(x)","display":false}],"bytes":2808,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-prop-dynamic-parity]]、[[29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach]] — 奇偶性与无环图可达关系的动态维护"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-prop-dynamic-parity]]"}],"outgoing":["f49962f64360a930"]}